    {
      "type": "thinking",
      "thinking": "I'm planning the full single-file app structure: handling person entries with validation, expenses with payer/split logic using integer cents and leftover distribution by add-order, plus how balances will be calculated and displayed.\n\nFor settlement, I'm designing a greedy algorithm pairing creditors and debtors to minimize transfers to at most n-1. I'm also deciding on fonts (Fraunces for headings, Inter for body), amount validation via regex to avoid floating-point errors, and how error messages should appear/disappear based on form validity. Skipping person deletion to keep scope manageable.\n\nFor expenses, I'm defining the data shape with id, description, cents, payer, and split array, then computing shares by distributing cents evenly across split members with remainder going to the first few in people order. I'm working through form reset behavior — clearing description and amount after successful submission while resetting split checkboxes to all-selected, and re-rendering the payer/split UI whenever the people list changes. I'm also checking color contrast for the accent color (a reddish-orange) against white text to ensure accessibility.\n\nFor styling, I'm choosing a warm off-white background with a dark harbour-navy text color and muted secondary text, verifying all pass contrast guidelines. I'm laying out the page as a two-column grid on desktop (people/add-expense on the left, expenses/balances/settle on the right) collapsing to a single column on mobile, with a visible focus outline using the accent color. Now I'm writing the balance display logic, showing \"is owed\" for positive amounts, \"owes\" for negative, and \"even\" for zero.\n\nNow I'm deciding to keep the add-expense form always visible even when there are no people yet, showing a submit-time error instead of disabling the form, and starting to write the state management code for loading and persisting data from localStorage...\n\nContinuing with render functions for people, expense form, expense list, balances, and settlement summary, plus an HTML escaping helper and a robust amount parser that validates dollar strings and converts them to integer cents.\n\nFor the amount input I'm using a text field with decimal input mode rather than a number type, since that lets me preserve exactly what the user typed instead of losing invalid entries. For the settle-up algorithm, I'm separating people into creditors and debtors, sorting them by amount, then greedily matching the largest debts against the largest credits to minimize the number of transactions needed.\n\n",
      "signature": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en-CA\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Even Keel — split trip costs fairly</title>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,500;9..144,600&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n  :root{\n    --harbour:#1F3A4D;\n    --harbour-deep:#162B3A;\n    --harbour-tint:#E3EAEF;\n    --signal:#C2462B;\n    --signal-deep:#9E3521;\n    --signal-tint:#F8E7E2;\n    --paper:#F5F2EC;\n    --card:#FFFFFF;\n    --ink:#1A2A36;\n    --muted:#4D6271;\n    --line:#D6D0C4;\n    --sea:#2E6B5E;\n    --sea-tint:#E1EEEA;\n    --radius:10px;\n    --focus:0 0 0 3px #fff,0 0 0 6px var(--signal);\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n  body{\n    margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n    font-family:\"Inter\",system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;\n  }\n  h1,h2,h3{font-family:\"Fraunces\",Georgia,serif;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0;color:var(--harbour)}\n  :focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:var(--focus);border-radius:6px}\n  .skip{position:absolute;left:-999px;top:8px;background:#fff;padding:8px 12px;z-index:10}\n  .skip:focus{left:8px}\n\n  header.brand{\n    background:var(--harbour);color:#fff;padding:20px 0 0;\n  }\n  .wrap{width:min(1120px,100% - 32px);margin:0 auto}\n  .brand .wrap{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px 24px;padding-bottom:22px;border-bottom:4px solid var(--signal)}\n  .brand h1{color:#fff;font-size:30px;line-height:1.1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\n  .brand h1 svg{flex:none}\n  .brand p{margin:0;color:#C9D6DE;font-size:15px;max-width:40ch}\n\n  main{padding:28px 0 56px}\n  .grid{display:grid;gap:24px;grid-template-columns:1fr}\n  @media(min-width:860px){.grid{grid-template-columns:5fr 7fr;align-items:start}}\n  .col{display:grid;gap:24px}\n\n  section.card{\n    background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);\n    padding:22px;box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(31,58,77,.04)\n  }\n  .card h2{font-size:22px;margin-bottom:4px}\n  .card .lede{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14.5px}\n\n  label{display:block;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;color:var(--harbour);margin-bottom:6px}\n  .field{margin-bottom:14px}\n  input[type=text],select{\n    width:100%;font:inherit;padding:10px 12px;border:1.5px solid #B8C3CB;border-radius:8px;\n    background:#fff;color:var(--ink);min-height:44px\n  }\n  input[type=text]:focus-visible,select:focus-visible{border-color:var(--harbour);box-shadow:var(--focus)}\n  .row{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-end;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .row .field{flex:1 1 180px;margin:0}\n  .hint{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px}\n\n  button{font:inherit;cursor:pointer;border-radius:8px;min-height:44px}\n  .btn{\n    background:var(--signal);color:#fff;border:0;padding:10px 18px;font-weight:600;\n    transition:background .15s\n  }\n  .btn:hover{background:var(--signal-deep)}\n  .btn.navy{background:var(--harbour)}\n  .btn.navy:hover{background:var(--harbour-deep)}\n  .btn-ghost{\n    background:transparent;border:1.5px solid #B8C3CB;color:var(--harbour);padding:6px 12px;min-height:36px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500\n  }\n  .btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--signal);color:var(--signal)}\n\n  .error{\n    display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start;background:var(--signal-tint);border-left:4px solid var(--signal);\n    color:#7A2816;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;margin:12px 0 0;font-size:14.5px\n  }\n  .error svg{flex:none;margin-top:2px}\n\n  fieldset{border:0;padding:0;margin:0 0 14px}\n  legend{font-weight:600;font-size:14px;color:var(--harbour);margin-bottom:6px;padding:0}\n  .checks{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n  .checks label{\n    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:0;font-weight:500;\n    border:1.5px solid #B8C3CB;border-radius:999px;padding:7px 14px 7px 10px;background:#fff;cursor:pointer;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink)\n  }\n  .checks label:has(:checked){background:var(--harbour-tint);border-color:var(--harbour)}\n  .checks label:has(:focus-visible){box-shadow:var(--focus)}\n  .checks input{accent-color:var(--harbour);width:18px;height:18px;margin:0}\n  .checks input:focus-visible{box-shadow:none}\n\n  ul.list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n  .people li{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #ECE8DF}\n  .people li:first-child{border-top:0}\n  .avatar{\n    width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--harbour-tint);color:var(--harbour);\n    font-family:\"Fraunces\",serif;font-weight:600;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none;font-size:15px\n  }\n\n  .expenses li{padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid #ECE8DF;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:4px 14px;align-items:start}\n  .expenses li:first-child{border-top:0}\n  .expenses .desc{font-weight:600;color:var(--harbour)}\n  .expenses .amt{font-family:\"Fraunces\",serif;font-weight:600;font-size:19px;color:var(--harbour);text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n  .expenses .meta{grid-column:1;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\n  .expenses .act{grid-column:2;justify-self:end}\n\n  .balances li{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #ECE8DF}\n  .balances li:first-child{border-top:0}\n  .balances .who{font-weight:600;color:var(--harbour)}\n  .balances .state{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-left:8px}\n  .bal{font-family:\"Fraunces\",serif;font-weight:600;font-size:18px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}\n  .bal.pos{color:var(--sea)}\n  .bal.neg{color:var(--signal)}\n  .bal.zero{color:var(--muted)}\n\n  .transfers li{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-top:10px;background:var(--paper);flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .transfers .arrow{color:var(--signal);flex:none}\n  .transfers b{color:var(--harbour)}\n  .transfers .tamt{margin-left:auto;font-family:\"Fraunces\",serif;font-weight:600;font-size:18px;color:var(--harbour);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n\n  .empty{\n    border:1.5px dashed var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14.5px;text-align:center;background:var(--paper)\n  }\n  .empty strong{color:var(--harbour);display:block;font-family:\"Fraunces\",serif;font-size:17px;margin-bottom:2px}\n  .even{background:var(--sea-tint);border-left:4px solid var(--sea);padding:12px 14px;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;color:#1F4A41;font-size:14.5px}\n  .summary{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:12px}\n  .summary div{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\n  .summary div b{display:block;font-family:\"Fraunces\",serif;font-size:20px;color:var(--harbour);font-weight:600}\n  footer{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;text-align:center;padding:0 0 24px}\n  .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#app\">Skip to the app</a>\n<header class=\"brand\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h1>\n      <svg width=\"34\" height=\"34\" viewBox=\"0 0 34 34\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C2462B\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 19c3-3 7-3 10 0s7 3 10 0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M17 6v9\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>\n      Even Keel\n    </h1>\n    <p>Add the people on your trip, log who paid for what, and see who owes whom so everyone ends up even.</p>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"app\" class=\"wrap\" data-testid=\"app\">\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n    <div class=\"col\">\n      <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"h-people\">\n        <h2 id=\"h-people\">People</h2>\n        <p class=\"lede\">Everyone who's sharing costs on this trip.</p>\n        <form id=\"person-form\" novalidate>\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"field\">\n              <label for=\"person-name\">Name</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"person-name\" data-testid=\"person-name\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"e.g. Ana\">\n            </div>\n            <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn navy\" data-testid=\"add-person\">Add person</button>\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"person-error\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n        </form>\n        <div id=\"people\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"></div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"h-add\">\n        <h2 id=\"h-add\">Add an expense</h2>\n        <p class=\"lede\">One person paid; the cost is split equally between whoever you tick.</p>\n        <form id=\"expense-form\" novalidate>\n          <div class=\"field\">\n            <label for=\"expense-desc\">What was it for?</label>\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"expense-desc\" data-testid=\"expense-desc\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"e.g. Ferry tickets\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"row\" style=\"margin-bottom:14px\">\n            <div class=\"field\">\n              <label for=\"expense-amount\">Amount (CAD)</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"expense-amount\" data-testid=\"expense-amount\" inputmode=\"decimal\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"0.00\">\n              <div class=\"hint\">Dollars and cents, like 42.50</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"field\">\n              <label for=\"expense-payer\">Who paid?</label>\n              <select id=\"expense-payer\" data-testid=\"expense-payer\"></select>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <fieldset>\n            <legend>Split between</legend>\n            <div class=\"checks\" id=\"expense-split\" data-testid=\"expense-split\"></div>\n          </fieldset>\n          <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn\" data-testid=\"add-expense\">Add expense</button>\n          <div id=\"expense-error\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n        </form>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"col\">\n      <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"h-expenses\">\n        <h2 id=\"h-expenses\">Expenses</h2>\n        <p class=\"lede\">Newest first.</p>\n        <div id=\"expenses\"></div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"h-balances\">\n        <h2 id=\"h-balances\">Where everyone stands</h2>\n        <p class=\"lede\">What each person paid, minus their share of everything.</p>\n        <div id=\"balances\"></div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"h-settle\">\n        <h2 id=\"h-settle\">Settle up</h2>\n        <p class=\"lede\">The fewest transfers that bring everyone back to even.</p>\n        <div id=\"settle\"></div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</main>\n<footer>Everything is saved on this device. Owing a friend a little money is normal — this just keeps it clear.</footer>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  'use strict';\n  const KEY = 'evenkeel.v1';\n  const fmt = new Intl.NumberFormat('en-CA', { style:'currency', currency:'CAD' });\n  const money = c => fmt.format(c / 100);\n  const $ = id => document.getElementById(id);\n\n  let state = load();\n  function load(){\n    try{\n      const s = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY));\n      if (s && Array.isArray(s.people) && Array.isArray(s.expenses)) return s;\n    }catch(e){}\n    return { people: [], expenses: [] };\n  }\n  function save(){ try{ localStorage.setItem(KEY, JSON.stringify(state)); }catch(e){} }\n\n  function esc(s){ return String(s).replace(/[&<>\"']/g, m => ({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;',\"'\":'&#39;'}[m])); }\n  function initials(n){ return n.trim().split(/\\s+/).slice(0,2).map(w => w[0].toUpperCase()).join(''); }\n\n  const errIcon = '<svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"8\" r=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M8 4.5v4M8 11v.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>';\n  function showError(el, msg){ el.innerHTML = '<p class=\"error\" role=\"alert\" data-testid=\"form-error\">' + errIcon + '<span>' + esc(msg) + '</span></p>'; }\n  function clearError(el){ el.innerHTML = ''; }\n\n  /* ---------- Shares ---------- */\n  function shares(exp){\n    const members = state.people.filter(p => exp.split.includes(p));\n    const n = members.length, out = {};\n    if (!n) return out;\n    const base = Math.floor(exp.cents / n), rem = exp.cents - base * n;\n    members.forEach((p, i) => { out[p] = base + (i < rem ? 1 : 0); });\n    return out;\n  }\n  function balances(){\n    const b = {};\n    state.people.forEach(p => b[p] = 0);\n    state.expenses.forEach(e => {\n      if (b[e.payer] !== undefined) b[e.payer] += e.cents;\n      const sh = shares(e);\n      for (const p in sh) b[p] -= sh[p];\n    });\n    return b;\n  }\n  function settle(b){\n    const cred = [], debt = [];\n    state.people.forEach(p => { if (b[p] > 0) cred.push({name:p, cents:b[p]}); else if (b[p] < 0) debt.push({name:p, cents:-b[p]}); });\n    cred.sort((a,c) => c.cents - a.cents); debt.sort((a,c) => c.cents - a.cents);\n    const out = []; let i = 0, j = 0;\n    while (i < debt.length && j < cred.length){\n      const d = debt[i], c = cred[j], amt = Math.min(d.cents, c.cents);\n      out.push({ from:d.name, to:c.name, cents:amt });\n      d.cents -= amt; c.cents -= amt;\n      if (d.cents === 0) i++;\n      if (c.cents === 0) j++;\n    }\n    return out;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Render ---------- */\n  function renderPeople(){\n    const el = $('people');\n    if (!state.people.length){\n      el.innerHTML = '<div class=\"empty\"><strong>No one here yet</strong>Add the first person on the trip to get started. You can add yourself.</div>';\n      return;\n    }\n    el.innerHTML = '<ul class=\"list people\">' + state.people.map(p =>\n      '<li data-testid=\"person\"><span class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">' + esc(initials(p)) + '</span><span>' + esc(p) + '</span></li>'\n    ).join('') + '</ul>';\n  }\n\n  function renderExpenseForm(){\n    const sel = $('expense-payer'), prev = sel.value;\n    sel.innerHTML = state.people.length\n      ? state.people.map(p => '<option value=\"' + esc(p) + '\">' + esc(p) + '</option>').join('')\n      : '<option value=\"\">Add a person first</option>';\n    if (state.people.includes(prev)) sel.value = prev;\n    const split = $('expense-split');\n    split.innerHTML = state.people.length\n      ? state.people.map((p, i) => '<label for=\"split-' + i + '\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"split-' + i + '\" value=\"' + esc(p) + '\" checked>' + esc(p) + '</label>').join('')\n      : '<span class=\"hint\">The people you add will appear here.</span>';\n  }\n\n  function renderExpenses(){\n    const el = $('expenses');\n    if (!state.expenses.length){\n      el.innerHTML = '<div class=\"empty\"><strong>Nothing logged yet</strong>' + (state.people.length ? 'Add the first expense — a meal, a tank of gas, the place you stayed.' : 'Once you\\u2019ve added people, you can log what they paid for.') + '</div>';\n      return;\n    }\n    const total = state.expenses.reduce((s,e) => s + e.cents, 0);\n    el.innerHTML = '<div class=\"summary\"><div><b>' + money(total) + '</b>spent so far</div><div><b>' + state.expenses.length + '</b>' + (state.expenses.length === 1 ? 'expense' : 'expenses') + '</div></div>' +\n      '<ul class=\"list expenses\">' + state.expenses.slice().reverse().map(e =>\n        '<li data-testid=\"expense\">' +\n          '<div class=\"desc\">' + esc(e.desc) + '</div>' +\n          '<div class=\"amt\">' + money(e.cents) + '</div>' +\n          '<div class=\"meta\"><b style=\"color:var(--harbour);font-weight:600\">' + esc(e.payer) + '</b> paid · split between ' + esc(e.split.join(', ')) + '</div>' +\n          '<div class=\"act\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-ghost\" data-testid=\"delete-expense\" data-id=\"' + e.id + '\" aria-label=\"Remove ' + esc(e.desc) + '\">Remove</button></div>' +\n        '</li>').join('') + '</ul>';\n  }\n\n  function renderBalances(b){\n    const el = $('balances');\n    if (!state.people.length){\n      el.innerHTML = '<div class=\"empty\"><strong>No balances yet</strong>Add people and expenses and you\\u2019ll see where everyone stands.</div>';\n      return;\n    }\n    el.innerHTML = '<ul class=\"list balances\">' + state.people.map(p => {\n      const c = b[p], cls = c > 0 ? 'pos' : c < 0 ? 'neg' : 'zero';\n      const st = c > 0 ? 'is owed' : c < 0 ? 'owes' : 'is even';\n      return '<li data-testid=\"balance\" data-person=\"' + esc(p) + '\" data-cents=\"' + c + '\">' +\n        '<span><span class=\"who\">' + esc(p) + '</span><span class=\"state\">' + st + '</span></span>' +\n        '<span class=\"bal ' + cls + '\">' + (c > 0 ? '+' : c < 0 ? '\\u2212' : '') + money(Math.abs(c)) + '</span></li>';\n    }).join('') + '</ul>';\n  }\n\n  function renderSettle(b){\n    const el = $('settle');\n    const t = settle(b);\n    if (!state.people.length || !state.expenses.length){\n      el.innerHTML = '<div class=\"empty\"><strong>Nothing to settle</strong>Transfers will show up here once there are expenses to balance out.</div>';\n      return;\n    }\n    if (!t.length){\n      el.innerHTML = '<div class=\"even\">Everyone is even. Nothing to pay back.</div>';\n      return;\n    }\n    el.innerHTML = '<p class=\"hint\" style=\"margin:0\">' + t.length + (t.length === 1 ? ' transfer' : ' transfers') + ' and you\\u2019re done.</p><ul class=\"list transfers\">' + t.map(x =>\n      '<li data-testid=\"transfer\" data-from=\"' + esc(x.from) + '\" data-to=\"' + esc(x.to) + '\" data-cents=\"' + x.cents + '\">' +\n        '<b>' + esc(x.from) + '</b><span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\\u2192</span><span class=\"sr-only\">pays</span><b>' + esc(x.to) + '</b>' +\n        '<span class=\"tamt\">' + money(x.cents) + '</span></li>').join('') + '</ul>';\n  }\n\n  function renderAll(){\n    const b = balances();\n    renderPeople(); renderExpenseForm(); renderExpenses(); renderBalances(b); renderSettle(b);\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Handlers ---------- */\n  $('person-form').addEventListener('submit', ev => {\n    ev.preventDefault();\n    const input = $('person-name'), errEl = $('person-error');\n    const name = input.value.trim();\n    if (!name){ showError(errEl, 'Give this person a name before adding them.'); input.focus(); return; }\n    if (state.people.some(p => p.toLowerCase() === name.toLowerCase())){\n      showError(errEl, '\\u201C' + name + '\\u201D is already on the trip. Try adding a last initial if there are two of them.'); input.focus(); return;\n    }\n    clearError(errEl);\n    state.people.push(name); save();\n    input.value = '';\n    renderAll(); clearError($('expense-error'));\n    input.focus();\n  });\n\n  function parseCents(str){\n    const s = str.trim().replace(/^\\$/, '').replace(/,/g, '');\n    if (!/^\\d+(\\.\\d{1,2})?$/.test(s)) return null;\n    const parts = s.split('.');\n    return parseInt(parts[0], 10) * 100 + parseInt(((parts[1] || '') + '00').slice(0, 2), 10);\n  }\n\n  $('expense-form').addEventListener('submit', ev => {\n    ev.preventDefault();\n    const errEl = $('expense-error');\n    const descEl = $('expense-desc'), amtEl = $('expense-amount'), payer = $('expense-payer').value;\n    const desc = descEl.value.trim();\n    const split = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('#expense-split input:checked')).map(i => i.value);\n    if (!state.people.length){ showError(errEl, 'Add at least one person before logging an expense.'); $('person-name').focus(); return; }\n    if (!desc){ showError(errEl, 'Say what the expense was for.'); descEl.focus(); return; }\n    const cents = parseCents(amtEl.value);\n    if (cents === null){ showError(errEl, 'Enter the amount in dollars and cents, with no more than two decimal places (like 42.50).'); amtEl.focus(); return; }\n    if (cents <= 0){ showError(errEl, 'The amount needs to be more than $0.00.'); amtEl.focus(); return; }\n    if (!state.people.includes(payer)){ showError(errEl, 'Choose who paid.'); $('expense-payer').focus(); return; }\n    if (!split.length){ showError(errEl, 'Tick at least one person to split this between.'); document.querySelector('#expense-split input').focus(); return; }\n    clearError(errEl);\n    state.expenses.push({ id: Date.now() + '-' + Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 7), desc, cents, payer, split });\n    save();\n    descEl.value = ''; amtEl.value = '';\n    renderAll();\n    descEl.focus();\n  });\n\n  $('expenses').addEventListener('click', ev => {\n    const btn = ev.target.closest('[data-testid=\"delete-expense\"]');\n    if (!btn) return;\n    state.expenses = state.expenses.filter(e => e.id !== btn.dataset.id);\n    save(); renderAll();\n    const first = document.querySelector('[data-testid=\"delete-expense\"]');\n    (first || $('expense-desc')).focus();\n  });\n\n  renderAll();\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>"
